Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(本片开始)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:11.81,0:00:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是比较特别的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:24.75,0:00:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要找年轻的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要新的感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.77,0:00:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:41.84,0:00:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开会一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太天真了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.73,0:01:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次要冒险一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.73,0:01:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是要找不会看气氛的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.80,0:01:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以是怎样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.74,0:01:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:24.81,0:01:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以开吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.76,0:01:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.83,0:01:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.84,0:01:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:49.77,0:01:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(丑闻 番外篇 在酒吧被带上床的蒂亚）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.79,0:02:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很红呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.73,0:02:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.80,0:02:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出道多久了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出道到现在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多5年了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.74,0:02:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很快红呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.75,0:02:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人喜欢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.84,0:02:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很可爱呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.78,0:03:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢喝酒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.85,0:03:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悠闲地过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会喝酒呀？ -是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.79,0:03:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都喝什么呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.73,0:03:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红酒还有威士忌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.73,0:03:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啤酒呢？-还好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是也会喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.81,0:03:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.78,0:04:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很美味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.78,0:04:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会比较有感觉呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.79,0:04:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有喜欢的男优吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.73,0:04:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就喜欢的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.74,0:04:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能很难说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是私底下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有比较好相处的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.76,0:04:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不到喜欢呀？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.77,0:05:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因是私底下的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.77,0:05:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能很难说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有工作关系吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.80,0:05:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.80,0:05:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好说呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.81,0:05:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么继续录咯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.75,0:05:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有跟其他的厂商合作吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.82,0:06:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前还没有想过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这里帮我很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.83,0:06:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是报恩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.83,0:06:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以继续就继续
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.84,0:06:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我再关掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.84,0:06:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以说一下真心话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.80,0:06:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.73,0:06:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他们的作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的拍得很漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.75,0:06:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很唯美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.81,0:07:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是很喜欢的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.76,0:07:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.77,0:07:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我送你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.79,0:07:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是听到很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.73,0:07:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样很棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:20.83,0:08:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正就这样下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.77,0:08:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带摄影机过去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.78,0:08:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.78,0:08:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是一般的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.79,0:08:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作后之后吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.79,0:08:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会喝一些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.74,0:09:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上都这
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.81,0:09:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会去一些店里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.82,0:09:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后可以的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.77,0:09:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有用过吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.84,0:09:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.78,0:09:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛的中间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有摄影机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.78,0:09:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.79,0:10:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.73,0:10:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很怪呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.80,0:10:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.74,0:10:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把人带上床
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.82,0:10:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很糟糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.75,0:10:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样该可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.79,0:11:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边也有摄影机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.73,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.73,0:11:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不行的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.74,0:11:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有人出来帮你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.75,0:11:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.77,0:11:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都准备好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在重要的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是女优部分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.75,0:12:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.82,0:12:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你很久了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.83,0:12:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经确认了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.77,0:12:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有其他事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.77,0:13:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先谈吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到他走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.79,0:13:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.73,0:13:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很可爱呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.74,0:13:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己的衣服呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.81,0:13:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.74,0:13:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的地方很不错呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.75,0:13:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.77,0:14:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会想要多看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.72,0:14:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是比较厉害的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.74,0:14:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉上部作品上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.74,0:14:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的很棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.77,0:15:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很漂呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.84,0:15:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拍出很棒的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.78,0:15:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.85,0:15:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有在读书吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.72,0:15:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.81,0:15:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的会帮忙呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.81,0:15:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.82,0:16:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.76,0:16:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.84,0:16:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里请
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.78,0:16:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.79,0:16:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是认识的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.79,0:16:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都有合作呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想说你的跟你对手的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.82,0:17:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这位男优
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.84,0:17:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的很喜欢呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.79,0:17:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢喝酒吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.72,0:17:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情很好的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.73,0:17:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就会很顺利
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.82,0:18:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.83,0:18:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的人是很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.76,0:18:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.77,0:18:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.79,0:18:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.79,0:18:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私底下都是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.74,0:19:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感情算不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.75,0:19:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.82,0:19:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多喝一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.76,0:19:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醉了吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.77,0:19:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没醉啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.84,0:19:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很会喝呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.84,0:19:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉再一杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.79,0:20:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼神很下流呢
